OL,3,GNEWSACriminal networks 'targeting'
OL,4,AAsian families' gold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition is calling for tougher
OL,7,Faction against burglars who target
OL,8,Ffamilies of south Asian heritage for
OL,9,Ftheir gold jewellery.
OL,11,FMore than 1,200 people have signed
OL,12,Fsince it was launched in Wokingham a
OL,13,Fmonth ago.
OL,15,FAmong those being asked to intervene is
OL,16,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris, who
OL,17,Fcampaigners want to see toughen up
OL,18,Fsentencing guidelines to make
OL,19,F"deliberate cultural, demographic, or
OL,20,Fheritage profiling" an aggravating
OL,21,Ffactor, leading to longer jail terms.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
